      "description": "The layout direction of the button group. Note: this property does NOT set `aria-orientation` on the host because `aria-orientation` is only meaningful for roles that manage arrow-key navigation (e.g. `toolbar`, `listbox`). Since button-group uses sequential Tab navigation (not roving tabindex), the attribute would be invalid."
    },
